fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path><path d=\"M8.726 3.425c2.105-2.1 5.485-2.063 7.698.15s2.252 5.594.15 7.699L15.48 12.38a.875.875 0 0 1-1.244-1.231l1.095-1.107.003-.002c1.384-1.385 1.421-3.659-.147-5.227s-3.842-1.53-5.227-.147l-.003.003-1.106 1.095a.876.876 0 0 1-1.23-1.244z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path></svg>Share</button></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"contents\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0 in-data-article-contained:flex in-data-article-contained:flex-col\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Today, ChatGPT Enterprise is available through AWS Marketplace. The listing gives organizations a simpler way to discover, buy, and manage ChatGPT Enterprise using their existing AWS purchasing and billing relationship and to apply eligible spend toward their AWS commitments.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>More than</span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"/index/chatgpt-ads-expands-26-new-countries/\"><span> 1.2 billion people use ChatGPT each week</span></a><span>. ChatGPT Enterprise brings that familiar experience to work with ChatGPT, ChatGPT Work, Codex, and dots. With ChatGPT Enterprise now available in AWS Marketplace, AWS customers get the same models, features, and functionality available directly from OpenAI, with new features released at the same time.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>These OpenAI products </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"/index/openai-on-aws/\"><span>complement the OpenAI models available in Amazon Bedrock</span></a><span>. Developers can build AI applications and agents with OpenAI models in Amazon Bedrock, while teams across the business use ChatGPT Enterprise in their daily work. Organizations can choose the approach that fits their workloads and governance requirements.</span></p></div><div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6 py-8\"><section class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-8 @md:col-start-3\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-carousel-view\"><div class=\"mb-3 flex justify-end\"><div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3\" data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-controls\"><span class=\"text-meta text-primary-60\">1 of 3</span><div class=\"flex\"><button aria-label=\"Previous testimonial\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 focus:outline-primary-44 text-btn-media-label\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><use height=\"16\" href=\"/icons/cms/a7687e3ce5db398c/arrow-left-lg.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\"></use></svg></button><button aria-label=\"Next testimonial\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 text-primary-60 hover:bg-primary-4 hover:[&amp;&gt;svg]:opacity-60 focus:outline-primary-44 -ms-1 active:scale-95\" type=\"button\"><svg height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><use height=\"16\" href=\"/icons/cms/a7687e3ce5db398c/arrow-right-lg.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 relative rounded-md border shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08)] px-6 py-8\"><div class=\"no-scrollbar relative scroll-smooth snap-x snap-mandatory overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden overscroll-x-contain\" data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-scroll-region\"><div class=\"sticky inset-s-0 top-0 grid w-full\"><figure aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] opacity-100\"><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>Enterprises want to put AI to work across their teams without adding new layers of procurement. With ChatGPT Enterprise in AWS Marketplace, customers can buy it through their AWS account, govern it alongside the rest of their software spend, and move from evaluation to rollout faster. Working with OpenAI, we’re bringing one of the world’s most widely used AI products to AWS customers.</span>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\"><span>—Matt Yanchyshyn, Vice President, AWS Marketplace and Partner Services, AWS</span></figcaption></figure><figure aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0\" inert=\"\"><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>Enterprises increasingly rely on both AWS and OpenAI to put AI to work, and our partnership is about making that combination stronger for them. Joint customers can now bring ChatGPT to their teams through the cloud provider they already trust. Together with AWS, we’re simplifying the path to adoption and helping more organizations unlock what’s possible with AI at scale.</span>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\"><span>—Chris Grusz, Managing Director, Cloud Partnerships, OpenAI</span></figcaption></figure><figure aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0\" inert=\"\"><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>Bringing ChatGPT Enterprise to AWS Marketplace gives companies like Sophos a simpler path to expand AI across our teams. Having the option to buy through a single channel and apply existing AWS commitments removes friction that often slows enterprise AI adoption. Time that would otherwise go to procurement can go toward using AI to deliver more value for our customers.</span>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\"><span>—John Peterson, Chief Technology Officer, Sophos</span></figcaption></figure></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-0 w-full\"><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div></div></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 -translate-inline-1/2 pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[-0.4rem] z-1 hidden size-3 rotate-45 rounded-xs border-e border-b md:block\" data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-tail\" style=\"inset-inline-start:16.666666666666664%\"></span></div><div class=\"relative mt-3 overflow-hidden\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-1 hidden md:block\"><ul class=\"flex\" style=\"width:100%;mask-image:linear-gradient(#000 0 0);mask-position:0% 0;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-size:33.333333333333336% 100%;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(#000 0 0);-webkit-mask-position:0% 0;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-size:33.333333333333336% 100%\"><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">AWS</div></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">OpenAI</div></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">Sophos</div></li></ul></div><ul aria-label=\"Testimonials\" class=\"relative flex\" style=\"width:100%\"><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\"><button aria-current=\"true\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from AWS\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4 text-primary-100 md:text-primary-60\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-balance\